%\n•  深证成指：11389.74点，+1.32%\n•  创业板指：2572.07点，+3.11%（最强）\n•  科创50：1300.38点，+2.80%\n•  沪深300：4075.71点，+0.41%", "url": "https://x.com/zzzzd6bh/status/2120448756080689462"}, {"author_id": "137332930", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:55:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120410027118989511"], "id": "2120410027118989511", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 13043, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股盘中｜2026-11-11 北京时间14:30\n\n #结论", "url": "https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2120410027118989511"}, {"author_id": "2107689248782716928", "created_at": "2026-11-12T07:36:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120782779889987768", "2120782903890370706"], "id": "2120782779889987768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股2026年11月12日盘后复盘：\n\n冲高回落、个股普跌，机器人主线仍在但情绪进入退潮", "url": "https://x.com/zzzzd6bh/status/2120782779889987768"}, {"author_id": "2850084973", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:23:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120417220857880852"], "id": "2120417220857880852", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 219, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收评：全线大反攻！创业板大涨3%，沪指时隔29日重新站上20日线\n\n今天A股终于迎来久违的集体反弹，市场做多情绪全面回暖。各大指数全线拉升，创业板大涨超3%，沪指成功收复关键压力位，重新站上20日均线，走出了近期最强的修复行情。\n\n从盘面热点来看，今天市场主线非常明确：超跌科技题材集体爆发。", "url": "https://x.com/naruha7007/status/2120417220857880852"}, {"author_id": "2055926930915172352", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:59:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320387733217561"], "id": "2120320387733217561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 145, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "所有人都盯着隔夜美股大跌，等着A股跟着低开，我只整理客观数据，不猜今天开盘涨跌！\n\n1. A股昨日收盘实况（11.10）\n上证3663.72点，小幅收涨0.08%；创业板大涨1.46%，分化极其明显。\n两市成交1.50万亿，较前一日放量222亿元，仅统计沪深两市，不混入三市成交额口径。", "url": "https://x.