26-11-12T15:18:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120898968767094939"], "id": "2120898968767094939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 415, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "截至最新A股交易日收盘后的官方统计数据显示，全市场融资融券业务的合计总余额报22656.44亿，这一数值已经创下了近14周以来的阶段新高，也代表着场内杠杆资金的整体持仓规模站上了2.2万亿的关键整数关口，相比前一个交易日的两融余额数据，当天的总规模多了74.92亿，这个单日增量在近30个交易日的历史", "url": "https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2120898968767094939"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:56:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120410197294514259"], "id": "2120410197294514259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天这盘面，我最大的感受就一句话：指数看着没劲，底下其实已经“换了天地”。 https://t.co/8RDGO5kw2N", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2120410197294514259"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:25:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120870501858042336"], "id": "2120870501858042336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 859, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天这根上影线太长了：沪指冲3700又被打回来，收3655.83跌0.67%；创业板早盘还涨近2%，收盘-2.44%。1.95万亿放量，4600多只票绿着——兄弟们，早上买的是不是都在骂人。\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2120870501858042336"}, {"author_id": "1746181597228150784", "created_at": "2026-11-12T00:56:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120682015624487082"], "id": "2120682015624487082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2264, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "📋 A股盘前 11-12（周四）\n\n🎯 今日打法：💰3-5成 · 🟢光模块/CPO/光芯片回踩低吸、不追高开 · 动手条件=旭创/新易盛高开≤3%且09:45站稳分时均价，回踩525/205分批；高开≥6%只减不加\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🌍 一、隔夜外围\n\n· 🟢 美股：道指 52,486.49（+0.49%）｜纳指", "url": "https://x.com/alfonsxh/status/2120682015624487082"}, {"author_id": "1746181597228150784", "created_at": "2026-11-12T07:45:14.000Z"